@startuml state-share-link
!include ../_style/rahyaab-uml.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
title A parent share link (UML state machine)
[*] --> Active : student creates link
Active --> Active : parent views / views + 1
Active --> Revoked : student stops sharing
Active --> Expired : after 30 days
Revoked --> Deleted : retention job (30 days)
Expired --> Deleted : retention job (30 days)
Deleted --> [*]
@enduml
